lingxi-code/test_entry

# test-harness conversation capture artifacts (regenerated)
lingxi-code/test-harness/conversation-*.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-app template `.lingxi/` documents are SOURCE, not tool state.
# `.lingxi/` above ignores the runtime state directory everywhere, but the
# app templates ship a committed `.lingxi/source-policy.json` (and the Next
# template's manifest/design-spec) that engine-mobile `include_bytes!`s and
# the supply-chain verifier reads. Without these negations `git add` silently
# skips them and a fresh clone cannot compile engine-mobile.
# The directory itself must be re-included first: git never descends into an
# excluded directory, so a file-only negation would never be reached.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
!lingxi-code/local-apps/templates/*/.lingxi/
!lingxi-code/local-apps/templates/*/.lingxi/**
